<title>ESTONIA: HOIU LIISING TO ISSUE 30 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</title>
<headline>HOIU LIISING TO ISSUE 30 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiu Liising, the leasing firm of Hoiupank , will issue 30 million kroons in commercial papers on August 1, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Three-month papers will yield seven percent, the bank's capital markets head, Hassar Kipp, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
